 "strings": {
  "Yeah, let's meet up in front of Kamuro Theater.": "",
  "(Hmm. Should I buy a present for Sana-chan before our date?)": "",
  "(I bet Le Marche has some good stuff.)": "",
  "We got cut off, but you all good?": "",
  "I got in touch with Ayabe.": "",
  "He's scraping up what he can on the Mole thing.": "",
  "Just sit tight 'til we hear back, cool?": "",
  "(Should I take Nanami out?)": "",
  "Take her out.": "",
  "Take her nowhere.": "",
  "Hey, wanna meet up somewhere? That is, if you have time.": "",
  "I always have time for you.": "",
  "Then let's meet up at Theater Square. In front of our usual arcade.": "",
  "Got it. I'll head over once I'm ready.": "",
  "(Oh, I know. I should buy her a present beforehand.)": "",
  "(Le Marche should have just what I'm looking for.)": "",
  "Hey, remember that outfit I got you? Wanna wear that today?": "",
  "Sure! I was struggling with my outfit today anyway.": "",
  "Thanks for coming out with me today. I had a great time with you.": "",
  "As did I. Invite me out again sometime, okay?": "",
  "Sure. Let's keep in touch.": "",
  "Definitely!": "",
  "Nanami-san. Thanks for helping out with the investigation today.": "",
  "I did not.": "",
  "Well, when you find out what happens, please let me know!": "",
  "Yukko-san. About that plan we talked about...": "",
  "Oh, the fake investigation? Are you finally up to the task?": "",
  "Actually, no.": "",
  "Yeah. That seems to be the only way to go about it.": "",
  "Now that's what I'm talking about!": "",
  "All you have to do is invite Nanami out and let me know in advance!": "",
  "Gosh, you're so indecisive!": "",
  "Well, let me know if you ever change your mind.": "",
  "(All right. Time to enact the plan.)": "",
  "Hello there.": "",
  "Hello there yourself! How are you?": "",
  "Listen to your conscience.": "",
  "Hey, Nanami-san. If you're free right now, wanna meet up somewhere?": "",
  "Yes! Definitely!": "",
  "Where to?": "",
  "I think Theater Square would be the easiest place.": "",
  "You're right. Let's meet there, then.": "",
  "I'm looking forward to it.": "",
  "Me too!": "",
  "Hey, Nanami-san. Are you and Yukko free right now? I'd be down to hang out if you are.": "",
  "Yeah, I am actually! I think Yukko should be as well.": "",
  "Glad to hear that. Let's meet up at Theater Square then.": "",
  "(Wait, this would be a bad time to call her.\nBetter wait until I'm alone in the office.)": "",
  "Really!? Me too! Can I head over to your office, then?": "",
  "Yeah. I'll be here.": "",
  "(Nah, sounds like has something important to talk about. Now's not the time to be making wardrobe requests.)": ""
 },
